# Shared passcode for the whole app. Server only: never prefix it with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Required on Vercel (the app refuses every request without it). Locally, if unset, the passcode is "dev".
# It is the only thing protecting the data, so make it long and random (e.g. `openssl rand -base64 18`).
# Changing it signs everyone out.
APP_PASSCODE=

# Set by Vercel when a Blob store is connected to the project. Do not create it by hand and do not commit it.
# Leave it unset for local development: data is then kept in .data/store.json.
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
